WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.830
Have you ever wondered what SCP-043, The Beatle,
wants?

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:09.889
Foundation researchers used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-043 while

00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:13.670
it was being questioned as it sat on its turntable.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.009
This was the result:

00:00:15.009 --> 00:00:17.529
"Being replaced into its sleeve."

00:00:17.529 --> 00:00:23.190
Like many anomalies in the custody of the
Foundation, it appears that SCP-043 just wants

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.509
to be left alone.

